      Announcing the Wireless Battle Mesh v6
   (15th of April - 21st of April 2013, Aalborg, Denmark)
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
